:artwork_20260103_173226_943 rdf:type arto:Artwork ;
    dcterms:title "Artwork 20260103 173226 943"@en ;
    dcterms:description """A Impressionism painting depicting a bright and cheerful afternoon scene in a gentle, active atmosphere. In the foreground, a large, weathered bronze lamp post with deep umber tones stands solidly next to a medium-sized table of golden ochre and honey-colored wood with a dry, matte finish. Under a large, warm cream and pale yellow sunshade that appears partially translucent from the soft natural afternoon light, the table supports a medium cobalt blue and pure white vase with a glossy, reflective surface. Beside the table, a large charcoal gray and deep slate stove made of cool-toned metal reflects the intense afternoon light with sharp highlights. The spatial arrangement shows the table positioned directly under the sunshade's protective canopy, with the vase centered on the table's surface, the lamp post standing firmly beside the table's left side, and the stove placed adjacent to the table's right side, all bathed in the warm, diffused glow of the late day."""@en ;
    arto:style aat:300021503 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-01-03T17:33:04.891156"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "AI Artwork Generation System" ;
    arto:medium arto:DigitalMedium .

